@startuml
!include _theme.puml
title Session — validite, expiration et revocation
caption UC02/04 · R4/R5 | MVP
[*] --> Valide : authentification reussie
state "Valide" as Valide
state "Expiree" as Expiree
state "Revoquee" as Revoquee
Valide --> Valide : requete [non expiree / droits de compte suffisants]
Valide --> Expiree : delai atteint
Valide --> Revoquee : deconnexion, revocation explicite\nou mot de passe reinitialise
Expiree --> [*]
Revoquee --> [*]
note right of Valide
  Compte incomplet : acces limite a la finalisation.
  Reconnexion : creation d'une nouvelle session,
  pas reactivation d'une session expiree / revoquee.
end note
@enduml
